---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Teaching and talks – Hanh Tran"
  description="Teaching and talks by Hanh Tran: VietAI instructor since 2021, seminars and community events."
  current="teaching"
  footer="compact"
>
<main style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; box-sizing: border-box">

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 40px 0 40px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600">Teaching &amp; talks</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--body); max-width: 32em; text-wrap: pretty">I have taught machine learning and applied AI since 2021, to more than 1,200 students across 10 VietAI cohorts, from first-time learners to working engineers.</p>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 170px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">VietAI</h2>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Instructor · 2021 – now</div>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 0 0 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Generative AI for Everyone</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Aug 2024</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Build Applications with OpenAI API</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Oct 2023</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">ChatGPT/Bard for Everyone</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">May 2023</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Foundation of Deep Learning</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">since 2021</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 14px 0 0">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Pre-Machine Learning</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">since 2021</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 170px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Talks</h2>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 0 0 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Terminology in the era of LLMs</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Seminars at the University of Coimbra, Portugal, and the University of Malta · Jul 2024</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 14px 0 0">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Women in AI and Women Techmakers</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Speaker at community events</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 170px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Earlier</h2>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 0 0 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Python Trainer · MCI Vietnam</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Python for Data Analysis; Python for Machine Learning and Deep Learning</div>
</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2021 – 2022</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 24px; padding: 14px 0 0">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0">
<div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600">Program Manager · BeeCode Vietnam</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Computer science classes and summer schools</div>
</div>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2016 – 2017</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 170px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Open source</h2>
</div>
<p style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Contributor to open course material: robotics-course, agents-course and mcp-course, plus tutorials for ML practitioners on <a href="https://zootopi.dev/blog">zootopi.dev</a>.</p>
</section>

</main>
</Layout>
